                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Microsoft Sans Serif</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a9ae7061-acc5-414e-b122-620c493b7be9</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">25</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The ShapeDiver plugin contains three types of file input components: Import Text, Import Bitmap and Import Geometry.

The three components will generate an upload button in the ShapeDiver viewer which users can use to upload their own files.

User the context menu to define which file types should be allowed.

You can also input a URL string to define the default file if none was defined by the user.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>423.0058</X>
